# Fixed defect 2613, 2026-11-20, lane umbrella-2: a private module of a
# placed part, named by the program, is told once, as private, whether the
# part holds it (`text/internal/scan`, placed with `text`) or not, its
# version holding it (`flags/internal/bits`). The first was told
# `package_not_listed` with a note offering `heroes add
# kit/text/internal/scan`, then `private_module`; the second
# `package_not_listed` alone, its note offering the same kind of line.
use <kit>/csv
use <kit>/text/internal/scan  #~ private_module
use <kit>/flags/internal/bits  #~ private_module

function main()
    print(csv.first("a,b"))
    print(scan.first_at("a,b", mark: ','))
    print(bits.one())
